    "## 3. Load the prepared master dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "This executable version intentionally uses **one input path only**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The CSV must already contain the engineered sector, macro and GDELT features plus the next-day target columns. The supplied `master_with_target.csv` generated from the project data has this structure.\n",
    "\n",
    "The target is:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target(t) = 1 if Close(t+1) > Close(t), otherwise 0.**\n",
    "\n",
    "No raw market/GDELT files are required by this notebook."
   ]
