    "## 9. Explainability\n",
    "\n",
    "The requested feature-importance and edge-heatmap views are included here.\n",
    "\n",
    "Because this notebook is intentionally dependency-free, the explanation is **gradient-based saliency**, not the PyG `GNNExplainer` class. It answers the same high-level research questions—what inputs and graph connections most influence a selected prediction—without falsely labeling a different algorithm as GNNExplainer."
   ]
  },
